T2 DUPLEX | THE SENTINEL - Two Floors, Two Balconies and the Sea a Few Steps Away

Two floors. Two balconies. An exclusive way to live in the heart of Costa da Caparica.

Imagine living just a few minutes walk from the beach, in a brand new flat where contemporary architecture, comfort and functionality meet.

Welcome to O Sentinela, an exclusive development with an artistic signature by Vhils, which transforms the building into a true work of urban art.

More than a flat, this T2 Duplex is an invitation to live differently.

TWO FLOORS. MORE SPACE TO LIVE.

With an intelligent distribution over two floors, this flat offers a natural separation between the social area and the private area.

On the lower floor, the living room and the open space kitchen create a modern and welcoming environment, ideal for receiving friends, sharing meals or relaxing. This floor also has a bathroom, storage space and a balcony that extends the living area to the outside.

On the upper floor, there are two bedrooms, a second bathroom and another balcony, providing a reserved environment, dedicated to rest and privacy.

A configuration that combines the functionality of a flat with the feeling of independence of a home.

COMFORT AND QUALITY IN EVERY DETAIL

Carefully selected materials and equipment to provide elegance, efficiency and comfort all year round.

Apartment highlights:

- New T2 Duplex, spread over two floors;

- Two bedrooms and two bathrooms;

- Two balconies;

- Living room and kitchen in open space;

- Storage space;

- Kitchen equipped with built-in Bosch appliances;

- Silestone worktop;

- Daikin air conditioning;

- Multilayer wooden flooring;

- High thermal and acoustic insulation;

- Class A energy certification;

- Building with two elevators.

A WORK OF ART TO CALL HOME

Sentinela is distinguished by its contemporary architecture and a façade marked by an exclusive mural by Vhils, one of the most internationally recognised Portuguese artists.

This artistic signature gives the building a unique identity, transforming it into a striking element of the urban landscape of Costa da Caparica.

An address with personality, for those who value difference.

THE PRIVILEGE OF HAVING THE SEA AS A NEIGHBOUR

Imagine starting the day with a walk on the beach, having a coffee in the centre of Costa da Caparica and having everything you need just a few steps from home.

Located in the central square of Costa da Caparica, O Sentinela benefits from a privileged location, surrounded by restaurants, shops, supermarkets, schools, services, transport and green spaces.

A location where everything happens:

- About 6 minutes walk from the beaches;

- 350 meters from Rua dos Pescadores and the Municipal Market;

- 16 km from Lisbon;

- 23 km from Humberto Delgado Airport;

- Close to the future Metro connection to Costa da Caparica, foreseen in the expansion plans.

Here, the tranquillity of living by the sea meets the convenience of being close to Lisbon.

YOUR NEXT HOME STARTS HERE

Whether for own housing, second home or investment, this T2 Duplex brings together features that make the difference: new construction, two floors, two balconies, quality finishes and a central location just minutes from the beach.

All this in a development with a truly unique architectural and artistic identity.

THE SENTINEL - It's not just where you live. It's how you choose to live.

Contact us to know the plan, finishes and purchase conditions. Schedule your visit and discover this T2 Duplex!

